2026-07-27T11:30:13.8425004Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:30:13.8425378Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:30:13.8425706Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:30:13.8426203Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:30:13.8427667Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:30:13.8430918Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
